      "source": "$ django-admin\r\n\r\nType 'django-admin help <subcommand>' for help on a specific subcommand.\r\n\r\nAvailable subcommands:\r\n\r\n[django]\r\n    check\r\n    compilemessages\r\n    createcachetable\r\n    dbshell\r\n    diffsettings\r\n    dumpdata\r\n    flush\r\n    inspectdb\r\n    loaddata\r\n    makemessages\r\n    makemigrations\r\n    migrate\r\n    runserver\r\n    sendtestemail\r\n    shell\r\n    showmigrations\r\n    sqlflush\r\n    sqlmigrate\r\n    sqlsequencereset\r\n    squashmigrations\r\n    startapp\r\n    startproject\r\n    test\r\n    testserver\r\n……省略部分……",
